# Context filter for builds whose context is linux/ (currently the webserver
# image via linux/docker-compose.yml). The ROOT .dockerignore does not apply to
# this context, so without this file the entire linux/ tree — scripts,
# llm-stack, vulkan, nvidia-local-debs — uploads as build context.
#
# NOTE: webserver/dist MUST stay included here. The root .dockerignore excludes
# **/dist/ for root-context builds; do not copy that rule into this file.
*
!webserver/nginx.conf
!webserver/entrypoint.sh
!webserver/dist/
!webserver/license-assets/
